WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit tall and bend the left knee so the left shin is parallel to the front of the mat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Stack the right shin directly on top, right ankle over left knee.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Flex both feet to protect the knees.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Stay upright or hinge forward gently with a long spine.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Unwind carefully and switch the stacking order.
